OL,3,GNEWSAPorts calls for responsible
OL,4,Afishing around harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant harbour master Mike Harris
OL,7,Fsaid he had seen an "increasing number
OL,8,Fof incidents over recent months".
